# Pairs with EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission (E -> R). E's entry check loses its
# loaded-entry conjunct for S, so after the purge unloads S's entry a straddler is admitted.
MODULE: EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmissionUnloadedAdmitted
TARGET: EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: E's entry check admits a straddler on an unloaded entry
PERTURBS: StraddlerAlloc

--- FIND
        /\ EAppendLoaded("S")
        /\ EAppendAdmits("S", s)
--- REPLACE
        /\ EAppendAdmits("S", s)
--- END
